Test requested moves between nodes whose Proxmox VE versions differ in whether
they keep the guest identity. Only a source node that keeps the identity
refuses a target that would drop it.

The expected outcome is:
- The moves of vm:101 and ct:102 from node1 to node2 are done, as node1 does
  not keep the guest identity either
- The moves of vm:101 and ct:102 from node2 to node3 are done, as node3 keeps
  the guest identity
- The moves of vm:101 and ct:102 from node3 back to node1 are refused before
  the services are stopped. Both keep running on node3
